# CompactList, the apps' list (cp0_ui_list.h, cp0_ui_widgets.hpp), on a page of its own (listdemo: the Page scaffold,
# the shared status strip, the list in the roller's column under the header, an input group on the keypad).
# Top-aligned: row 0 right under the header, the highlight starts there and walks down; the list scrolls only to keep
# the highlight and one row of context in view (never centred); no chevrons; a thin scrollbar at the right edge while
# scrolling, gone 1 s later, none when every row fits.
#   Compact, 40 rows (a system monitor: two section headers, value tones, long labels cut with dots, values never
#   cut): at the top with the scrollbar flashed, the highlight moved down 10 items, a live refresh (same rows, new
#   values and tones: highlight and scroll unchanged), End, idle (scrollbar gone), a finger drag down (the list
#   scrolls back with momentum, the highlight stays on the last item, now out of view).
#   Comfortable, 3 rows (all fit: top-aligned, no scrollbar): a tap selects row 2, a second tap activates it (title).
#   Comfortable, 12 rows: at the top, 6 items down (scrolled), End.
#   Compact read-only with separators: no highlight, Down scrolls by a row. Compact, 0 rows: the empty-state line.
title compact list
sizes 640x480 800x480 720x720 480x320
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
header home
listdemo compact 40
shot list_compact_top
header list_compact "List demo"
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
shot list_compact_middle
listdemo update
shot list_compact_refreshed
key END
shot list_compact_end
wait 1500
shot list_compact_idle
drag 240 140 240 300
shot list_compact_dragged
listdemo comfortable 3
shot list_comfortable_3
@640x480 tap 320 175
@800x480 tap 400 150
@720x720 tap 360 170
@480x320 tap 240 106
shot list_comfortable_3_selected
@640x480 tap 320 175
@800x480 tap 400 150
@720x720 tap 360 170
@480x320 tap 240 106
shot list_comfortable_3_activated
listdemo comfortable 12
shot list_comfortable_12
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
shot list_comfortable_12_scrolled
key END
shot list_comfortable_12_end
listdemo compact 40 readonly separators
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
shot list_readonly_separators
listdemo compact 0 empty "No serial ports found"
shot list_empty
